<title>UK: Sole Brent cargo from chains kept by equity holder.</title>
<headline>Sole Brent cargo from chains kept by equity holder.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The only Brent crude oil cargo passing through the paper chains on Monday has been kept by the equity holder, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo is due to load in the October 22-24 range and was kept by Exxon, the equity holder.</p>
<p>Good demand for sweet North Sea crudes saw all four of Friday's dates kept before the five o' clock deadline.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 71 542 8978</p>
